{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《美食新聞報道》帶領觀眾兵分兩路，除了遠赴吉隆坡品嚐米芝蓮推介的正宗肉骨茶，更在香港荃灣尋找高性價比的平民印尼美食與特色咖啡。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>吉隆坡米芝蓮推介：興記肉骨茶</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">由陳國強師傅帶領主持林映暉（暉哥）前往吉隆坡，推介多款惹味地道美食：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">興記肉骨茶</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：LOT 3541-A, Near RHB Bank, BT 7, Jln Kepong, Kepong Baru, 52000 Kuala Lumpur</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"60b65bfe-eab1-48c3-a200-0129642fc54d.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026rKNionpvNI1785053817.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"60b65bfe-eab1-48c3-a200-0129642fc54d.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"032b2091-8bcf-4035-ba95-d1bbe1d9b318.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026QYPX8gEpCw1785053817.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"032b2091-8bcf-4035-ba95-d1bbe1d9b318.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\